docs {
  ## What this proves
  The `_SUCCESS` marker exists and is empty. Reporting's pre-check waits on exactly this object.

  ## Captures
  Nothing.

  ## Consumes
  - `s3_marker_key` from `06 XCom publish.marker_key`

  ## When it fails
  404: extraction did not publish, or 90-chaos removed the marker and its restore request (`D12`) was not sent.
}
